## 📊 3. UI状態管理戦略（TanStack Router Search Params優先）

### **基本方針：Search Paramsを優先したUI状態管理**

TanStack Router Search ParamsがUI状態管理実装で優先されるべき考慮事項であるというスタンスを維持します。

### **Search Params統合UI状態管理パターン**

```tsx
// ✅ 推奨：Search Paramsを中心とした状態管理
function ProductListingPage() {
  const search = Route.useSearch(); // @tanstack-router.mdcパターン
  const navigate = useNavigate({ from: Route.fullPath });

  return (
    <div className="container mx-auto py-6">
      <div className="space-y-6">
        {/* 検索・フィルター */}
        <ProductSearchForm />

        {/* レスポンシブレイアウト */}
        <div className="lg:flex lg:gap-6">
          {/* サイドバーフィルター */}
          <aside
            className={cn(
              "lg:block lg:w-64",
              search.showFilters ? "block" : "hidden lg:block",
            )}
          >
            <ProductFilters />
          </aside>

          {/* 商品グリッド */}
          <main className="flex-1">
            <div className="space-y-4">
              {/* モバイルフィルタートグル */}
              <div className="lg:hidden">
                <Button
                  variant="outline"
                  onClick={() =>
                    navigate({
                      search: { ...search, showFilters: !search.showFilters },
                    })
                  }
                >
                  {search.showFilters ? "Hide" : "Show"} Filters
                </Button>
              </div>

              {/* 商品一覧 */}
              <div className="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
                <Suspense fallback={<ProductGridSkeleton />}>
                  <ProductGrid />
                </Suspense>
              </div>
            </div>
          </main>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}
```

### **Search Params統合フォーム**

```tsx
// @tanstack-router.mdcパターンとの統合
function ProductSearchForm() {
  const search = Route.useSearch();
  const navigate = useNavigate({ from: Route.fullPath });

  const form = useForm({
    defaultValues: {
      query: search.query || "",
      category: search.category || "",
      sort: search.sort || "newest",
      priceRange: search.priceRange || [0, 1000],
    },
    onSubmit: async ({ value }) => {
      navigate({
        search: (prev) => ({ ...prev, ...value, page: 1 }),
      });
    },
  });

  return (
    <Card className="p-6">
      <form
        onSubmit={(e) => {
          e.preventDefault();
          form.handleSubmit();
        }}
        className="space-y-4"
      >
        <div className="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
          <form.Field
            name="query"
            children={(field) => (
              <div className="space-y-2">
                <Label htmlFor={field.name}>Search</Label>
                <Input
                  id={field.name}
                  placeholder="Search products..."
                  value={field.state.value}
                  onChange={(e) => field.handleChange(e.target.value)}
                />
              </div>
            )}
          />

          <form.Field
            name="category"
            children={(field) => (
              <div className="space-y-2">
                <Label htmlFor={field.name}>Category</Label>
                <Select value={field.state.value} onValueChange={field.handleChange}>
                  <SelectTrigger>
                    <SelectValue placeholder="Select category" />
                  </SelectTrigger>
                  <SelectContent>
                    <SelectItem value="all">All Categories</SelectItem>
                    <SelectItem value="electronics">Electronics</SelectItem>
                    <SelectItem value="clothing">Clothing</SelectItem>
                  </SelectContent>
                </Select>
              </div>
            )}
          />

          <form.Field
            name="sort"
            children={(field) => (
              <div className="space-y-2">
                <Label htmlFor={field.name}>Sort By</Label>
                <Select value={field.state.value} onValueChange={field.handleChange}>
                  <SelectTrigger>
                    <SelectValue />
                  </SelectTrigger>
                  <SelectContent>
                    <SelectItem value="newest">Newest</SelectItem>
                    <SelectItem value="price-low">Price: Low to High</SelectItem>
                    <SelectItem value="price-high">Price: High to Low</SelectItem>
                  </SelectContent>
                </Select>
              </div>
            )}
          />

          <div className="flex items-end">
            <Button type="submit" className="w-full">
              Search
            </Button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </form>
    </Card>
  );
}
```

### **UI状態のリアルタイム同期**

```tsx
// リアルタイムSearch Params同期
function ProductFilters() {
  const search = Route.useSearch();
  const navigate = useNavigate({ from: Route.fullPath });

  // Search Paramsの変更をリアルタイムで反映
  const handleFilterChange = (key: string, value: any) => {
    navigate({
      search: (prev) => ({ ...prev, [key]: value, page: 1 }),
    });
  };

  return (
    <Card className="p-6">
      <div className="space-y-6">
        <div>
          <h3 className="mb-3 font-semibold">Price Range</h3>
          <PriceRangeSlider
            value={search.priceRange || [0, 1000]}
            onValueChange={(value) => handleFilterChange("priceRange", value)}
          />
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 className="mb-3 font-semibold">Brands</h3>
          <div className="space-y-2">
            {brands.map((brand) => (
              <div key={brand.id} className="flex items-center space-x-2">
                <Checkbox
                  id={brand.id}
                  checked={search.brands?.includes(brand.id)}
                  onCheckedChange={(checked) => {
                    const newBrands = checked
                      ? [...(search.brands || []), brand.id]
                      : search.brands?.filter((b) => b !== brand.id) || [];
                    handleFilterChange("brands", newBrands);
                  }}
                />
                <Label htmlFor={brand.id}>{brand.name}</Label>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Card>
  );
}
```

